/Title (Observation: For frames sent by the host to the internet, the destination MAC is that of the default gateway \(router\), not the remote server, because MAC addresses are only meaningful within one link. ARP requests use the broadcast destination FF:FF:FF:FF:FF:FF, while replies are unicast. The first three bytes \(OUI\) of each MAC identify the NIC vendor.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 626 0 R
/Prev 737 0 R
